ode_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-05-31T19:27:37Z","updated_at":"2026-06-14T16:45:59Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproduced on Godot v4.4, v4.5, v4.6 and v4.7-beta1.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.beta1.mono - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 15.94 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe emit flag `EMIT_FLAG_ROTATION_SCALE` for `GPUParticles3D.emit_particle` seems to only apply rotations to the emitted particle, not scale. The docs even mentioned that the scale should be applied.\n\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- From the MRP attached, play the `test.tscn` scene and hit \"Space\" to emit a particle (or anything that fits the \"ui_accept\" action).\n- The emitted particle should have a rotation of 90 degrees clockwise and a scale varying between 0 and 1. The latter is not the case.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp_emit_flag.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28443042/mrp_emit_flag.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119920/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119920/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}